From 4d22eeea61105f74038c3f532e8ea7cabddb91d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nats-qnx <nats-qnx@localhost>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:02:27 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test: do not use <execinfo.h>/backtrace() on QNX

QNX does not provide glibc's <execinfo.h> (it has its own libbacktrace
with the bt_* API). Guard the include and the SIGSEGV backtrace dump the
same way Android is already guarded, so the upstream test-suite compiles.
---
